3..494.\nThe book explicitly prints all six answer letters.","leader":null},{"id":"ne3ambmq","x":39.668156768722,"y":84.69175022592165,"text":"Q1: B - CLOSED SPLINE\nThe view boundary must be closed.\nQ2: A - CROP VIEW\nRestrict the displayed region with a closed sketch.","leader":null},{"id":"n74h6dle","x":169.7724584280507,"y":84.69175022592165,"text":"Q3: B - ALTERNATIVE POSITION VIEW\nOverlay a second assembly pose.\nQ4: B - BREAK VIEW\nShorten a long view using break lines.","leader":null},{"id":"n88lnr7k","x":299.8767600873794,"y":84.69175022592165,"text":"Q5: D - ALIGNED SECTION VIEW\nAlign the angled cutting-plane portions.\nQ6: B - CLOSED PROFILE: SPLINE\nDefine the local section boundary.","leader":null},{"id":"ng6qot34","x":39.668156768722,"y":149.743901055586,"text":"PRINTED ANSWER ORDER: B / A / B / B / D / B\nThis worksheet records the source answers and view concepts.\nIt does not certify every advanced view workflow in ModelForge.\nNo native solid, imported publisher model or external exam result.","leader":null}],"primitives":[],"title":{"revision":"A","sheet":1,"sheets":1,"title":"CHAPTER10 - DRAFTING SAMPLE ANSWERS","number":"PLANCHARD 10-13..14 / PDF493..494","author":"","company":"","material":"","finish":"","mass":"","date":"2026-10-10","tolerance":""},"seeded":true},"lastStandardsAudit":{"at":1791623195512,"ok":true,"checked":0,"blocking":[]},"exactTopologyCache":{}},"assemblies":[],"drawings":[],"metadata":{"generator":"ModelForge CAD SolidWorks-Class","units":"mm","attachmentStorage":"content-addressed","activeDocument":{"type":"part","key":"cm_mv265fim"}},"attachments":[]}